{"id":"a-inf-1711","category":"info","cover":"","region":"global","publishedAt":"2024-04-20","addedAt":"2026-10-13T11:56:50.164Z","tags":[],"title":{"zh":"2024年3月新车灯光欣赏","en":"","ko":""},"summary":{"zh":"Audi Q6 e-tron上榜理由：无他，唯图多尔~看图即可\n\n领克07上榜理由：送给美丽的内饰氛围灯。看渲染图还挺好看的，不知道实物效果如何了。\n\n其他车灯赏析Audi A3日","en":"","ko":""},"body":{"zh":"Audi Q6 e-tron上榜理由：无他，唯图多尔~看图即可\n\n领克07上榜理由：送给美丽的内饰氛围灯。看渲染图还挺好看的，不知道实物效果如何了。\n\n其他车灯赏析Audi A3日行位置灯全部像素化已成为新一代家族特征。\n\nBAIC ArcFox Alpha S HI\n\nBAIC ArcFox Alpha T5\n\nBAIC Beijing BJ60\n\nBMW iX2\n\nBMW Vision Neue Klasse X Concept\n\nDodge Charger Daytona\n\nHyundai i30\n\nInfiniti QX80\n\nKia K4\n\nNissan Kicks\n\nPeugeot E-5008\n\nPorsche Panamera\n\nPorsche Taycan Turbo GT\n\nRivian R2\n\nRivian R3X\n\nSkoda Epiq Concept\n\nVolkswagen ID.Buzz GTX\n\n东风风行海星S7\n\n极氪MIX\n\n翼真L380\n\n——本月分享到此结束，谢谢观赏——","en":"","ko":""},"source":{"name":{"zh":"车灯研究院","en":"Headlight Institute","ko":"차灯연구원"},"type":"web","url":"https://www.dengdengschool.com/article/zaoxing/1711.html","author":""},"content":[{"t":"text","v":"Audi Q6 e-tron上榜理由：无他，唯图多尔~看图即可"},{"t":"img","v":"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/bfpNckwxSiaNWPtKAVxZNJ3pOtKxyYQibo0Akic3gtx0gRaP9fpH7KxicD5dARbHr4FEztl9hBWU3hjXloIibTYGvTA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&from=appmsg"},{"t":"img","v":"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/bfpNckwxSiaNWPtKAVxZNJ3pOtKxyYQibo72wlWYFSpkE2nRf7wibQqYqwfgEicYCcXXI3mdJumKdric8Yk1S4B2ZvA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&from=appmsg"},{"t":"img","v":"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/bfpNckwxSiaNWPtKAVxZNJ3pOtKxyYQibo9YuSMgHIxgEGxTEOhMzyew6BrXWbgdjzIGd1Y2c4ickpclDibw0ZEqDQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&from=appmsg"},{"t":"img","v":"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/bfpNckwxSiaPJiaKR4aXeYia5VxhicAK2xlicmtR1LUgZvRYJtnZr0YaPxqvgeiaXVOHQBVNqWtSBFxHedA4sjmBiboJw/640?wx_fmt=png&from=appmsg"},{"t":"img","v":"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/bfpNckwxSiaPJiaKR4aXeYia5VxhicAK2xlicdrx7MeaACIVyia4JP94ZCjQR1dFJqkYMib6MFStoaZZgfLI8MfJiavSEw/640?wx_fmt=png&from=appmsg"},{"t":"img","v":"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/bfpNckwxSiaPJiaKR4